 <span class="mood-option fs-1" data-mood="happy" title="Vui vẻ">😊</span>
 <span class="mood-option fs-1" data-mood="calm" title="Bình yên">😌</span>
 <span class="mood-option fs-1" data-mood="neutral" title="Bình thường">😐</span>
 <span class="mood-option fs-1" data-mood="tired" title="Mệt">😴</span>
 <span class="mood-option fs-1" data-mood="sad" title="Buồn">😢</span>
 </div>
